Reference data shipped with schema ref (TLD-REF1, 2026-11-06)

Country and territory names are CLDR 49 English territory names for idStatus=regular.
The Unicode License v3 notice below travels with that data. The LDML specification
publication (UTS #35 / tr35) is not shipped. Its license is not this data license.

Address applicability flags are derived from the libaddressinput address-metadata
snapshot whose content_sha256 is 6b9fdecb197299829a44bb271ecabf25e719e2f57a821cca33e263e3c26fa870.
The archived README says: "Source code licensed under the Apache 2.0. Data licensed
under the CC-BY 4.0". This product ships the derived flags, not the archived wiki HTML.
Attribute the data to the libaddressinput address metadata, CC BY 4.0.

Time zone identifiers are from IANA tzdata 2026f (zone1970.tab plus Etc/UTC).
The tzdata LICENSE says the data is in the public domain unless a file says otherwise.
The BSD-licensed files named there (date.c, newstrftime.3, strftime.c) are not in this data.

